; The member/element spelling of fixed/null (`[v: true / null]`, map values, and table values) uses
; the same deterministic singleton owner as the rule-level form, so this field is
; `Option<FixedBoolTrue>`. It is deliberately a separate parse path from the rule-level collapse;
; both must continue to generate under default and preserve-encodings profiles.
a = [v: true / null, x: uint]
